\addvspace {10\p@ }
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces (a)透過拉曼光譜量測繪製出的應力分布圖。(b)與(a)對應區域的SHG強度分布圖。\blx@tocontentsinit {0}\cite {Chiang_2023}}}{3}{figure.caption.6}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.2}{\ignorespaces (a)缺陷h-BN的SHG強度圖，明顯高於無缺陷結構。(b)因經由機械剝離的h-BN其缺陷較少，圖中也可觀察到其SHG強度較微弱。\blx@tocontentsinit {0}\cite {Cunha_2020}}}{3}{figure.caption.7}%
